182		// Honest severity: nothing the heuristic detector emits is "high" — that tier is reserved for a
183		// future high-confidence (locus+recency) signal. changed (0.8) is rename-ambiguous -> medium;
184		// deleted (0.65) is noisier/opt-in -> low.
